            "DatePublished": "Oct 12, 2024",
            "ReviewBody": "I have lived here since the building was 50% full. It was great for my first few years. Now it seems to have fallen off quite a bit. Ive had a request in for a repair to the ceiling above my shower for 3 months that has not been fixed ir looked at. Our leasing manager left and no communication, the new person, well i think its his replacement, is cold. I walked in and was interrorgated about if i live here, if my dog is registered etc Immediatly. They didnt say hi, introduce themselves or anything. It was a very negative first interaction to someone who is supposed to help make this place feel like home. I hope things change back to how it was, a lot of fellow tenants feel the same way.",
            "Author": {
              "type": "Person",
              "name": "Anonymous"
            },
            "ReviewRating": {
              "type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": 3.1
            }
          },
